data=col1,Crystal Shield
data=col2,invention_icon_perks_armour_crystal_shield
data=col4,Has a 10% chance to activate on taking damage, lasting 10 seconds. 5% of damage taken per rank is totaled for this period, becoming temporary lifepoints afterwards. These last either 30 seconds or until depleted through further damage. (1 minute cooldown)<br><col=0xE3D7CF>This perk has an increased chance to activate on level 20 items.</col>
data=col7,1,40,30,0
