// 1968
[uitutorial_combat_academy_session_7_part3]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,A stun ability has been placed on your action bar.<br>Attack Lady Deathknell and use the ability.
data=col10,1
data=col13,1

// 1969
[uitutorial_combat_academy_session_7_part4]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,Damage-over-time abilities damage your opponent multiple times over a short period.<br>Once the initial attack is performed, you can carry on attacking while the rest of the damage is dealt.<br>The <col=FFCB05>Freedom</col> ability will remove damage-over-time effects on you.
data=col13,1

// 1970
[uitutorial_combat_academy_session_7_part5]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,Dummy text - Player should not see.
data=col13,1

// 1971
[uitutorial_combat_academy_session_7_part6]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,A damage-over-time ability has been placed on your action bar.<br>Attack Lady Deathknell and use the ability.
data=col10,1

// 1972
[uitutorial_combat_academy_session_7_part7]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,Notice the way one ability hits you multiple times.
data=col13,1

// 1973
[uitutorial_combat_academy_session_7_part7_next]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,Dummy text - Player should not see.

// 1974
[uitutorial_combat_academy_session_7_part8]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,A combo attack has been placed on your action bar.<br>Attack Lady Deathknell and use the ability.<br>Using a stun ability on an opponent who is performing a combo attack will interrupt it.
data=col10,1

// 1975
[uitutorial_combat_academy_session_7_part9]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,Attack the central training dummy and use the multi-target ability to hit them all.
data=col10,1

// 1976
[uitutorial_combat_academy_session_7_part10]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,Collect food and set up your action bar for the upcoming fight.<br>Remember to place a stun, a combo attack, a damage-over-time ability and a multi-target ability on your action bar.<br>Tip: add more basic abilities to your action bar to help build adrenaline.

