// 3187
[arch_infernalsource_opening_cutscene]
table=image_sequence
data=col0,14
data=col1,30
data=col3,arch_cutscene_infernalsource_01,I struggle to understand the monolith's directions to the 'Source'.<br>It points north-west, but the distance and depth are unclear, variable.,arch_opening_cutscene_infernalsource_01,600,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_infernalsource_01,At least Movario seems confident we are digging in the right place. He explores<br>rumours of a cult that seemingly operated in this area throughout the Third Age.,arch_opening_cutscene_infernalsource_02,600,false,true,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_infernalsource_02a,Though what the Source itself actually is remains a mystery.<br>Perhaps all of this is due to the chaotic nature of the thing?,arch_opening_cutscene_infernalsource_03,450,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_infernalsource_02a,The monolith revealed this chaotic nature to me.<br>That is why it is so interested in learning more about the Source...,arch_opening_cutscene_infernalsource_04,400,false,true,true,true

// 3188
[arch_infernalsource_closing_cutscene]
table=image_sequence
data=col0,15
data=col1,30
data=col3,arch_cutscene_infernalsource_01,Movario was right! The buried Star Lodge contained a secret<br>cult dungeon hidden beneath it, and within that a portal to the Source itself!,arch_closing_cutscene_infernal_source_01,600,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_infernalsource_01,How many were taken by this cult and sacrificed over the centuries?<br>It's horrific to even think about.,arch_closing_cutscene_infernal_source_02,450,false,true,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_infernalsource_02b,To have your soul ripped out to power a portal to Dis,<br>to bring forth demons into this world!,arch_closing_cutscene_infernal_source_03,450,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_infernalsource_02b,Dagon the Gatekeeper, an unwitting and unwilling participant in this hellscape,<br>is as much a victim as those sacrificed. Is Dagon what the monolith desired we uncover?,arch_closing_cutscene_infernal_source_04,650,false,true,true,true

