// 3506
[egwd_bik_opening_cutscene]
table=image_sequence
data=col0,37
data=col1,30
data=col3,black_placeholder,I was there, in the year of Croesus. The year the fungus killed fifty thousand people, and the Tenth Legion were annihilated.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_i_was_there_in_the_year,585,false,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_01,It was the Second Age, not long after the end of the Kharidian Campaign.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_it_was_the_second_age,302,true,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_01,An expedition returned from the Unquiet Ocean with a very unusual species of fungus.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_an_expedition_returned_alt2,352,false,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_01,The fools thought they could turn it into a weapon. A botanical plague they could unleash on the enemies of the Empire.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_the_fools_thought_they_could_turn_it_alt2,460,false,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_02,They called it Croesus. Its spores infested the bodies of the dead, spreading and growing.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_they_called_it_croesus,435,true,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_02,They fed it slaves, tested it, burned away weakness, forced it to evolve. They did their jobs far too well.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_they_fed_it_slaves_tested_it_alt1,520,false,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_02,After one serious breach, they were ordered to cease their work. They didn't.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_after_one_serious_breach_alt1,380,false,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_03,Inevitably, Croesus broke free into the city again, choking the streets with its putrescent growth.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_inevitably_croesus_broke_free,485,true,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_03,Nothing could stop it. Priests and guards alike were powerless, and their bodies only served to fuel its flourishing.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_nothing_could_stop_it_alt2,500,false,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_04,I was with the Tenth Legion when we were recalled from the border to combat the infestation.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_i_was_with_the_tenth_legion_when_we_were_alt2,380,true,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_04,After days of fighting, my wings ached and my dragonfire was spent.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_after_days_of_fighting_my_wings_ached,375,false,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_04,We razed miles of city to contain it. The Legion were almost completely wiped out. It still wasn't enough.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_we_razed_miles_of_city_to_contain_it_alt1,505,false,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_05,In the end Lord Zaros was forced to intervene personally. He *quarantined* this whole district - simply buried it beneath the earth.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_in_the_end_lord_zaros_was_forced_alt1,600,true,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_05,I thought the remains of Croesus were destroyed. They assured me they were destroyed!,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_i_thought_the_remains_of_croesus_were_destroyed_alt1,395,false,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_06,They say that of all the Elder Gods, Bik holds intelligent life in the greatest contempt.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_they_say_that_of_all_the_elder_gods,380,true,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_06,She must have found Croesus beneath the graveyard and revived it. Even now it feeds on the ancient dead.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_she_must_have_found_croesus,453,false,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_croesus_front_cutscene_06,It's already massacred every defender on this front. If we don't drive it back, it will tear the cathedral to pieces.,egwd_bik_croe_cutscene_vo_its_already_massacred_every_defender_on_this_front_alt1,525,false,true,true,true

