// 3752
[arch_orthen_opening_cutscene]
table=image_sequence
data=col0,22
data=col1,30
data=col3,arch_cutscene_orthen_01,Orthen, though evidently not the only dragonkin settlement<br>to be found on Gielinor, was both its first and its greatest.,arch_opening_cutscene_orthen_01,560,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_orthen_01,When Anachronia was brought forward in time, it gave us<br>the rare opportunity to study dragonkin civilisation,<br>even if only via the ruins of Orthen.,arch_opening_cutscene_orthen_02,660,false,true,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_orthen_02a,What secrets might we uncover about the dragonkin race from pre-history?<br>And what was their life like before the elder god curse that befell them?,arch_opening_cutscene_orthen_03,600,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_orthen_02a,Rumours abound among archaeologists of buried hoards of treasure, nefarious<br>entities waiting to be freed into the world, technologies beyond our own...,arch_opening_cutscene_orthen_04,720,false,true,true,true

// 3753
[arch_orthen_closing_cutscene]
table=image_sequence
data=col0,23
data=col1,30
data=col3,arch_cutscene_orthen_01,By all accounts, the dragonkin endured many hardships to even<br>arrive on this world. Their survival a constant struggle;<br>every scrap of progress a hard-won battle.,arch_closing_cutscene_orthen_01,720,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_orthen_01,Yet at their height, they were a technologically and socially advanced<br>people who had not lost sight of their cultural and spiritual roots.,arch_closing_cutscene_orthen_02,510,false,true,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_orthen_02b,We see them only as a threat, but their story is one of tragedy.<br>Perhaps there is hope they may one day reclaim some of their lost grandeur.,arch_closing_cutscene_orthen_03,660,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_orthen_02b,Regardless, the legacy of their original civilisation lives on<br>in the form of dragons, the newly returned dinosaurs,<br>and the mysterious (and elusive) Xolo tribe.,arch_closing_cutscene_orthen_04,780,false,true,true,true

