// 3892
[quest_azzanadra_start_2d_cutscene]
table=image_sequence
data=col0,26
data=col1,125
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_1,I was not always Azzanadra, your trusted friend.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_1,320,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_1,Six thousand years ago I was Azzanadra, Pontifex Maximus of the Zarosian Empire.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_2,450,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_1,I maintained civilisation and the rule of my lord against all those who called themselves gods.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_3,500,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_1,I am very familiar with Seren's influence.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_4,340,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_2,We can no longer rely on this council.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_5,260,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_2,They are completely under her sway now.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_6,260,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_2,In time they will recover their initiative, but for now they are nothing but puppets.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_7,460,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_3,Disappointing, but not unexpected.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_8,360,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_3,Seren is obsessed with the adult elder gods.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_9,330,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_3,Her guilt and shame blind her to the true threat.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_10,360,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_4,It is not the adults who are destined to destroy us. It is their unborn children.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_11,420,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_4,If they wake, they will devour this world, and in time, all worlds.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_12,440,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_4,If the best these fools can do is waste their time on senseless<br>appeasement, then it falls to us to save them.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_13,520,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_4,We must find the elder god eggs.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_14,220,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_4,We must stop them hatching.,vo_azzanadra_quest_intro_cutscene_15,260,false,true,true,true

// 3893
[quest_azzanadra_elder_halls_2d_cutscene]
table=image_sequence
data=col0,27
data=col1,125
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_1,This world was lush, once. Green and flourishing. A perfect womb for the sleeping gods.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_1,520,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_1,Within their shells, they slumbered in a yolk of incredible power.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_2,300,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_1,The currents of magic drove more and more energy into the eggs,<br>until they reached bursting point.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_3,420,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_2,Sensing the impending birth of their young, the adults pressed in close.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_4,360,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_2,With a touch they imparted their identities and their memories.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_5,350,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_3,The eggs burst open, and the hatchlings within emerged, ravenous.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_6,350,true,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_4,Their mere presence drained all life from the cavern around them.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_7,320,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_4,Within moments every other living thing nearby was dead, drained of all life.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_8,400,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_5,Nothing could stop them. The world was doomed.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_9,280,true,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_6,Further and further their reach expanded, blanketing everything.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_10,250,true,true,true,false
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_7,Further and further their reach expanded, blanketing everything.,silence,180,true,true,false,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_8,Minutes later, Freneskae was a desolate husk.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_11,300,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_8,The sated hatchlings travelled out into the universe to remake it.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_12,300,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_9,In time they grew old and hid eggs of their own beneath the surface of Gielinor.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_13,380,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_9,When they hatch, our world will suffer the same fate as Freneskae.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_14,350,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_9,We must stop them... somehow.,vo_azzanadra_quest_birth_cutscene_15_alt,350,false,true,true,true

