data=col3,Open crates to fill the <col=FFCD37>Crate Bonus</col> bar, when it's filled you'll receive a Crate bonus. These can include <col=FFCD37>Boosted Rarities</col>, <col=FFCD37>x5 Multipliers</col>, <col=FFCD37>Extra Prizes per key</col> & <col=0xB32AB6>Rare</col> Instant Rewards.
