data=col0,Gifts from the Heart
data=col1,Stacking parcel bonuses await!
data=col3,11
data=col5,Open parcels to earn <col=FFCD37>Heartments</col>, which can be exchanged for Valentine's cosmetics from previous years, or to help rack up bonuses to your prizes.
data=col6,Parcel Bonuses
data=col7,Parcel bonuses are buffs affecting the prizes you receive. You can have several active at once, including: Instant Rewards, Boosted Rarity, Prize Multipliers, Bonus Rewards.
