table=trh_promo_info
data=col0,Egg Hunt
data=col1,Complete egg hunts to unlock unique rewards, including Springtime Dungarees & Flower Baskets.
data=col3,11
data=col5,Hunt for <col=FFFF00>Easter eggs</col> to win rewards!<br>The <col=FFFF00>colour</col> of the eggs signifies the <col=FFFF00>rarity</col> of the reward inside.
data=col6,Bonus Egg
data=col7,Open all the small eggs to open the <col=FFFF00>Bonus Egg</col>.<br>Opening this will reward you with a bonus that affects all eggs in the next hunt, such as <col=FF6600>Boosted Rarity</col> and <col=FF00>Prize Multipliers</col>.
