// 6197
[pride_master_dbrow]
table=modal_p_choice_details
data=col1,0,false,Ace at Anthropology,Cold blooded but not cold hearted. In the land of giant lizards, a journal lies forgotten outside a volcanic lair.
data=col1,1,false,Love Letter,Love lingers, long after a heart is broken by grief. At the lowest point rests the last words of a good man.
data=col1,2,false,Family Matters,This couple have stolen hearts, but even a thief's heart can ache.
data=col1,3,false,What's in a Name?,A visitor from another world waits near the gate she came through.
data=col1,4,false,Good Dogs,By a manor enshrouded in permanent night, a journal rests in peace.
data=col1,5,false,Butterflies,It's amazing what you can find in basements. Particularly kitchen basements.
data=col1,6,false,A Thoughtful Gift,These two spirits avoid wolf whistles by talking privately upstairs.

