// 6828
[trh186_promo_info]
table=trh_promo_info
data=col0,Genie's Wishes
data=col1,Karima is here! She'll grant you wishes that can be enhanced for huge rewards!
data=col3,6
data=col5,Karima will let you select one of her wishes. Find Karima again by opening chests to be granted your wish!<br><br><col=0xF7F7F7>Claim</col> your wish reward once you find Karima, or you can <col=0xF7F7F7>enhance</col> your wish for even bigger rewards!
data=col6,Enhancing Wishes
data=col7,Enhancing a wish means you won't receive your reward immediately, but you will have the chance to receive an enhanced reward next time you find Karima.
data=col9,Promotion Information
data=col10,trh186_promo_info_bonuses

// 6829
[trh188_promo_info]
table=trh_promo_info
data=col0,Witch's Cauldron
data=col1,Use ingredients to alter the prizes you win, and earn some exclusive cosmetics!
data=col3,6
data=col5,Use <col=0xe8ce80>ingredients</col> to add stacking effects to every key you use! <col=0xe8ce80>Ingredients</col> are in the pot for a number of keys, before <col=0xbe2aeb>refilling</col> after a while.<br>Earn charges for <col=0x9a86f7>spells</col> to instantly <col=0xbe2aeb>refill</col> your <col=0xe8ce80>ingredients</col>, or <col=0xbe2aeb>remix</col> them into something else!<br>Look out for <col=0xF0BE79>bewitching cosmetics</col> to add to your collection!
data=col6,Taboo
data=col7,Look out for the rare reward, <col=rs3tli_tertiary_title_text_colour>Taboo the companion pet token</col>! There's a small chance it can be found with every key, or might appear as your bottom <col=0xe8ce80>ingredient</col>.
data=col9,Promotion Information
data=col10,trh188_promo_info_cosmetics
