// 6831
[trh186_promo_info_bonuses_summary]
table=trh_promo_info_summary_entry
data=col0,<col=0xF7F7F7>Finding Karima</col> will allow you to select one of the following wishes:

// 6832
[trh186_promo_info_multiplier]
table=trh_promo_info_summary_entry
data=col3,trh_multiplier_x7,100,100
data=col4,0
data=col5,Multiplier
data=col6,Be granted a <col=FF00>x5 multiplier for 3 chests</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to a <col=FF00>x7 multiplier for 7 chests</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- x5 Multiplier for 3 chests.<br>- x5 Multiplier for 5 chests.<br>- x5 multiplier for 7 chests.<br>- x7 Multiplier for 7 chests!<br><br>This wish has a 15% chance of appearing as a wish option.

// 6833
[trh186_promo_info_coins]
table=trh_promo_info_summary_entry
data=col1,coins_10000
data=col2,50000000
data=col4,5
data=col5,Coins
data=col6,Be granted <col=FF00>2.5 million coins</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to <col=FF00>50 million coins</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- 2.5 million coins.<br>- 5 million coins.<br>- 10 million coins.<br>- 20 million coins.<br>- 50 million coins!<br><br>This wish has a 0.18% chance of appearing as a wish option.

// 6834
