data=col1,trh155_angelic_lamp_huge
data=col2,2
data=col4,5
data=col5,Phoenix Lamps
data=col6,Be granted a <col=FF00>Large phoenix lamp</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to <col=FF00>2x Giant phoenix lamps</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- Large phoenix lamp.<br>- Huge phoenix lamp.<br>- Giant phoenix lamp.<br>- 2 x Giant phoenix lamps!<br><br>This wish has a 28% chance of appearing as a wish option.

