data=col5,Bubbling Lamps
data=col6,Be granted a <col=FF00>Large bubbling lamp</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to <col=FF00>2x Giant bubbling lamps</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- Large bubbling lamp.<br>- Huge bubbling lamp.<br>- Giant bubbling lamp.<br>- 2 x Giant bubbling lamps!<br><br>This wish has a 28% chance of appearing as a wish option.

