// 6884
[calendar_entry_update_havenhythe]
table=calendar_entry
data=col0,100
data=col1,1
data=col2,8790
data=col3,8796
data=col7,Havenhythe Part 1
data=col9,You have been called to the mysterious land of Havenhythe by a voice in your dreams. Amongst the imposing mountains, lush valleys and the sleepy village of Wendlewick, you'll discover new stories to tell, foes to face, and ways to train your skills.<br><br>Your newest adventure begins at the <col=0x00ffff>Rusty Anchor Inn</col> in <col=0x00ffff>Port Sarim</col>.
data=col26,4
data=col28,1
data=col29,0_47_50_39_56

// 6885
[calendar_entry_update_110_hunter]
table=calendar_entry
data=col0,101
data=col1,1
data=col2,8790
data=col3,8796
data=col7,110 Hunter
data=col9,Journey to Havenhythe for a plethora of new creatures to hunt!<br><br>Help out a local tribe of hill giants by stalking giant chinchompas and kebbits in an expansion to Big Game Hunter. Set up birdboxes and harvest them once birds have moved in. Snare jackalaopes for a new Summoning familiar, catch black chinchompas, and craft clockwork box traps that can catch multiple creatures before filling up. Don't worry if you're not quite a master hunter yet - there's plenty of new game to hunt at early to midgame levels too.

