// 6984
[trh189_promo_info]
table=trh_promo_info
data=col0,Ultimate Showdown
data=col1,Pirates join the showdown and all previous cosmetics are available!<br><br>Gain Showdown Sigils by playing the promotion. Spend these in the Showdown Store on Showdown cosmetics old and new!
data=col3,9
data=col5,Use Treasure Hunter keys and win rewards! Keys can be purchased or earned through completing quests and playing the game. You will also be given free daily keys every day!
data=col6,The Solstice Showdown
data=col7,Choose an inquisitor to attack! Whenever an inquisitor's life points drop to zero you will receive a guaranteed  <col=FFFF00>unowned piece of their faction's armour set</col> as well as a <col=FFFF00>sigil</col>!<br><br>Attacking the <col=FF6600>Solar Inquisitor</col> will provide you with a <col=FF00>guaranteed rarity bonus</col> whereas attacking the <col=3366FF>Lunar Inquisitor</col> will provide you with a <col=FF00>multiplier bonus</col>!
data=col9,Promotion Information
data=col10,trh189_promo_info_cosmetics
data=col10,trh189_promo_info_sigils_overview
data=col10,trh189_promo_info_multipliers
