data=col1,Princess
data=col2,Duke Hoarse's Dog
data=col3,
data=col5,quest_fort_princess
data=col7,3000
data=col8,-50
data=col11,The Duke's precious spaniel, and possibly the only being besides Rodney to whom he shows any affection.
data=col11,She seems to be a good girl, but is there evil hidden inside?
data=col15,false

// 7252
[quest_fort_casefile_suspect_iris]
