data=col1,Iris Ruthven
data=col2,Lumbridge Ambassador
data=col3,She/Her
data=col5,quest_fort_iris
data=col7,5000
data=col11,Duke Horacio's cousin, attending on behalf of the duchy of Lumbridge.
data=col11,A social butterfly with a seeming lack of social awareness, and a proclivity for stirring up drama.
data=col11,While she isn't the sharpest tool in the shed, she has a kind heart.
data=col15,false

