data=col5,Loose an arrow at the target with each key used. The closer your arrow lands to the bullseye the more points you receive. Keep gaining points to earn <col=FF6600>Woodland Archer's Outfit pieces</col> and more!<br><br>You'll have a chance to receive the <col=FF6600>Ranger Roll walk override token</col> with each arrow fired.
