data=col3,<col=FFCB05>Soul Supplies</col>, ran by <col=FFCB05>Lupe</col>, is the City of Um's <col=FFCB05>general store</col>.<br><br>Head over there to get a variety of ritual supplies - including <col=FFCB05>necroplasm</col>, <col=FFCB05>candles</col>, and <col=FFCB05>ghostly ink</col>.
