// 8328
[uitutorial_bp3_missions_intro_2]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,After selecting a mission, you can see more information about that mission in the side panel.
data=col6,bp3_missions_tab:mission_info
data=col7,-1
data=col8,3
data=col17,bp3_mission_icon_default_content
data=col23,bp3_missions_tab:mission_info,-1

// 8329
[uitutorial_bp3_missions_intro_3]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,<col=0x2EF8FF>Mission Chain</col> - Some missions are part of a chain which when completed and claimed, will unlock access to another mission that has its own task and rewards. You can use the buttons in the Mission Chain section to preview upcoming missions.<br><br><col=0x2EF8FF>Description</col> - This gives more information about what the task entails and how to make progress.<br><br><col=0x2EF8FF>Progress</col> - This shows how close you are to completing the mission. When the next mission in a chain is the same, progress will be able to go higher than the target so that you can keep making progress toward your next missions without having to claim the previous one first.<br><br><col=0x2EF8FF>Rewards</col> - The reward section will show you everything that you'll receive for completing and claiming the mission.<br><br><col=0x2EF8FF>Vis Wax</col> - Some missions will allow you to spend vis wax to make modifications to the mission.
data=col6,bp3_missions_tab:mission_info
data=col7,-1
data=col8,3
data=col17,bp3_mission_icon_default_content
data=col23,bp3_missions_tab:mission_info,-1

