// 12793
[q4_awareness_2023_update_1]
table=q4_awareness_2023_update
data=col0,Vorkath: Battle of Forinthry
data=col1,Releases: 20th November
data=col2,A new threat rises! Defend Fort Forinthry in the ultimate last stand against Vorkath, Zemouregal and his army of minions in this new quest.<br><br>Take part in a new multi-phase boss battle to earn exciting new rewards, including the new upgradeable Dracolich armour.<br><br>Quest requirements:<br>- Complete 'Ancient Awakening' quest<br>- Level 60 Necromancy<br>- Woodcutter's Grove Tier 1<br>- Botanist's Bench Tier 1
data=col3,q4_awareness_2023:update_large_1_background

// 12794
[q4_awareness_2023_update_2]
table=q4_awareness_2023_update
data=col0,Vorkath Hunt: Guard & Lantern
data=col1,Releases: 20th November
data=col2,Mr. Mordaut needs your help. Collect Vorkath Shards by completing tasks and fending off Zemouregal and Vorkath.<br><br>Combine eight of these shards to unlock exclusive Necromancy weapon cosmetic overrides and temporary buffs, such as the return of the infinite porter!
data=col3,q4_awareness_2023:update_large_2_background

// 12795
[q4_awareness_2023_update_3]
table=q4_awareness_2023_update
data=col0,Christmas<br>Village
data=col1,Releases: 27th November - 3rd January
data=col2,Embark on an all-new seasonal adventure. Join Santa and his trusty snow imps to spread holiday cheer throughout Gielinor.<br><br>Journey to the Christmas Village in the Land of Snow and discover fresh Christmas activities, new seasonal quest, classic and new holiday rewards, and more!<br><br>Deliver letters to Santa to get your place on the Nice List to earn special weekly presents.<br><br>Old favourites return with the Advent Calendar and Wrapping Paper.
data=col3,q4_awareness_2023:update_large_3_background

// 12796
[q4_awareness_2023_update_4]
table=q4_awareness_2023_update
data=col0,Combat Beta
data=col1,Releases: 30th October - January 2024
data=col2,We're looking for your feedback in our Combat beta!<br><br>Get involved and experiment with changes we've made to the original combat styles to bring them up to modern standards.<br>Check out some of the proposed changes below!<br><br>- Enable 'Damage Potential' for all combat styles for the player.<br>- Increase the 'Damage Cap' for all combat styles (from 10,000/12,000 to 30,000).<br>- Implement a simplified Critical Strike system for all combat styles.
data=col3,q4_awareness_2023:update_small_1_background

// 12797
[q4_awareness_2023_update_5]
table=q4_awareness_2023_update
data=col0,Community Hitlist
data=col1,
data=col2,Experience a flurry of quality of life updates throughout the festive period, featuring some of the most requested changes suggested by you, the players.<br><br>Look out for some highly anticipated Game Jam projects also making their way to Gielinor.
data=col3,q4_awareness_2023:update_small_2_background

// 12798
[q4_awareness_2023_update_6]
table=q4_awareness_2023_update
data=col0,Environmental Refreshes
data=col1,
data=col2,Watch as major parts of Gielinor receive a new lick of paint in a series of graphical updates including locations such as Entrana and various dungeons!<br><br>Look forward to further environmental refreshes in the future, starting with Kandarin in early 2024.
data=col3,q4_awareness_2023:update_small_3_background

// 12799
[q4_awareness_2023_update_7]
table=q4_awareness_2023_update
data=col0,Tech Updates
data=col1,
data=col2,Check out new updates to our tech!<br><br>Experience RuneScape with richer colours, thanks to new specular lighting updates, features such as improved interface and game resolution scaling, and more!
data=col3,q4_awareness_2023:update_small_4_background

