data=col3,Once you have completed enough collections, you will get a reward from the <col=8d52e5>Witch's Cauldron!</col> Containing prizes such as a piece of the <col=8d52e5>Springbloom Witch Outfit</col>, <col=8d52e5>Springbloom Witch Staff</col> and the <col=8d52e5>Springbloom Hime hairstyle</col>!
