data=col6,Complete the Springbloom Witch Outfit!
data=col7,Complete the Springbloom Witch Outfit today! Unlock outfit pieces through the <col=8d52e5>Witch's Cauldron!</col><br><br>If already unlocked, the outfit is replaced with: Large prismatic fallen star or 10 million coins.
