data=col7,15 Keys + 1,500 Wrapping Paper
data=col9,Get stuck into Christmas with 15 Treasure Hunter keys and 1,500 Wrapping Paper!<br><br>Wrapping Paper can be handed in to Noel in the Christmas Village to gain Christmas Presents and have a chance at earning the rare Purple Santa Hat!<br><br>Keys are used in the Treasure Hunter mini-game to unlock chests bursting with useful items to help you on your adventures.
