// 13100
[trh183_promo_info_powers_summary]
table=trh_promo_info_summary_entry
data=col0,At regular intervals, receive charges for <col=FFFF00>Powers</col>! Use these powers to change up the prizes on offer.<br><col=FFFF00>Reroll:</col> Rerolls all visible prizes, generating new options.<br><col=FFFF00>Multiplier:</col> Increases the multiplier of all visible prizes by <col=FF00>+1</col>. Can only be used once per generated set of prizes.<br><col=FFFF00>Freeze:</col> Freezes all prizes on screen, allowing you to claim more than one without them changing. Each frozen prize can only be claimed once.<br><br>Any unused power charges will be reset at the end of the promotion.

