[trh182_combat_ability_overrides_summary_2]
table=trh_promo_info_summary_entry
data=col0,When the <col=89CFF0>Echo of Arch-Glacor</col> is active, you can win the <col=0xB32AB6>Azure Hurricane (NEW!)</col>, <col=0xB32AB6>Azure Sunshine</col> and <col=0xB32AB6>Azure Berserk</col> override scrolls.<br>Find and defeat the <col=89CFF0>Echo of Arch-Glacor</col> to win all three!

