// 13189
[trh182_all_stars_summary]
table=trh_promo_info_summary_entry
data=col0,Each boss returns for <col=0xF0BE79>2 days</col> alongside a <col=0xF0BE79>new override</col>. On the final day, <col=0xF0BE79>all bosses and overrides</col> return!<br><br><col=0xF0BE79>7th & 8th March:</col> <col=FF0000>Echo of Zamorak</col> + Chaotic Overrides<br><col=0xF0BE79>9th & 10th March:</col> <col=89CFF0>Echo of Arch-Glacor</col> + Azure Overrides<br><col=0xF0BE79>11th & 12th March:</col> <col=AAFF00>Echo of Croesus</col> + Fungal Overrides<br><col=0xF0BE79>13th March:</col> All of the above!

