data=col3,What you see is what you get, with multipliers too!<br><br>Choose the prize you want with <col=0x26c914>prize multipliers</col> between 1 and 5 as well!<br><br>If you use <col=0xF0BE79>multi key mode</col>, the promo will choose the most valuable prize for you, depending on the rarity and multiplier of each available prize.

// 13337
[trh197_promo_info]
table=trh_promo_info
data=col0,Foresight
data=col1,Foresee the prizes contained within each chest.
data=col3,6
data=col5,Use Treasure Hunter keys to select chests and win rewards! The <col=FFFFFF>gems</col> floating above each chest show you exactly what <col=FFFFFF>prize</col>, <col=FFFFFF>amount</col> and <col=0xB32AB6>rarity</col> you'll get if you choose that chest, so you can always pick the prize that's right for you!
data=col6,Win More Ultra-Rare Prizes!
data=col7,Now with even more chances to win <col=0xB065FF>ultra-rare prizes</col> including <col=FFFFFF>boxes of deathtouched darts</col>, and <col=FFFFFF>processors</col>, which can consume large amounts of proteans and dummies in an instant!
data=col9,Promotion Information
data=col10,trh183_promo_info_rewards
data=col10,trh183_promo_info_multipliers

