[arch_research_daemonheim_dragonkin_statue]
table=arch_research
data=col0,64
data=col1,2
data=col2,arch_site_daemonheim
data=col3,Imposing Stature
data=col4,75
data=col6,Striking evidence of the dragonkin lays in plain view for us to discover.
data=col7,The team compared the detail and craftsmanship on the piece to others seen on Orthen and determined that it specifically represents one of the dragonkin factions.
data=col8,4000
data=col11,115

// 13734
[arch_research_daemonheim_lobby_remnants]
table=arch_research
data=col0,65
data=col1,2
data=col2,arch_site_daemonheim
data=col3,Rest at the New Frontier
data=col4,79
data=col6,Initial analysis suggests this was a frequently inhabited space.
data=col7,Our efforts uncovered evidence of this being a social space for meetings and social events. The boffins are now arguing about what kind of snacks they'll have at their next party.
data=col8,4000
data=col11,115
data=col15,arch_restoration_snuff_box_damaged,1

// 13735
[arch_research_daemonheim_depths_door]
table=arch_research
data=col0,66
data=col1,2
data=col2,arch_site_daemonheim
data=col3,On the Threshold of the Mind
data=col4,103
data=col6,This door has an extremely complex and fascinating locking mechanism. It will keep us entertained for a while.
data=col7,One of our researchers got lucky and figured out the lock - apparently, only those considered 'friendly' can pass, and they must 'brace' themselves for what lies beyond.
data=col8,6000
data=col11,50

// 13736
[arch_research_daemonheim_research_table]
table=arch_research
data=col0,67
data=col1,2
data=col2,arch_site_daemonheim
data=col3,Making Sense of Sense
data=col4,109
data=col6,Whatever research was being done here seems undecipherable at first glance.
data=col7,With Mr Mordaut's help we translated some disturbing experiment records. Our therapist is booked all week.
data=col8,4000
data=col11,115

// 13737
[arch_research_daemonheim_projection_engine]
table=arch_research
data=col0,68
data=col1,2
data=col2,arch_site_daemonheim
data=col3,Thought Process
data=col4,113
data=col6,We don't even know where to start. A whole supporting team of engineers are being called.
data=col7,We understand how it mechanically works, but not what purpose it might serve. This thing is still a mystery.
data=col8,6000
data=col11,50

