data=col0,Raising Rituals
data=col1,Complete rituals to raise new necromancy rewards from beyond the grave!
data=col3,8
data=col5,Use keys to prepare the ritual. With each tile you fill, you have a chance to discover a modifer on another tile, including <col=FFFF00>multipliers and guaranteed rarity</col>. Each ritual you complete awards <col=FFFF00>3 bonus prizes</col> including at least 2 new necromancy rewards.
