data=col0,Gifts from the Heart
data=col1,Open gifts to unlock new cosmetics and powerful bonuses.
data=col3,11
data=col5,Open gifts to earn <col=FFCD37>Love Letters</col>, <col=BD3026>Heartments</col>, powerful gift modifiers, as well as a variety of <col=FFCD37>cosmetic rewards</col> including new pets, outfits and aura overrides.
data=col6,Gift Bonuses
data=col7,Gift Bonuses are modifiers affecting the prizes you receive. These affect the minimum rarity of your prizes and multipliers.
