data=col3,Selecting gems will move <col=FF00>multipliers</col> and <col=8d52e5>rarities</col> down the trail. Your reward from the gem is multiplied by the <col=FF00>active multiplier</col> and of the <col=8d52e5>guaranteed rarity</col>!
