// 15502
[uitutorial_trh210_promo_currency_0]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,Each key used will give you <col=89CFF0>Loot</col>. Collect loot to spend on <col=89CFF0>Bonuses</col>.<br>Buying a bonus gives you the choice of two random <col=89CFF0>Bonuses</col>. One to <col=FF00>Increase your multipliers</col> and the other to <col=8d52e5>increase your rarities</col>.<br><br>You also have a chance of <col=89CFF0>Bonuses</col> appearing along the trail!
