data=col0,Smuggler's Spoils
data=col1,Take a peek at smuggled prizes, win new cosmetic rewards.
data=col3,6
data=col5,Take a peek in the smuggler's chests to pick the prize that's right for you! <br>See the rewards as you play with a chance to win the brand-new <col=FFFF00>Duskrunner's Outfit</col> cosmetic override and <col=FFFF00>Duskrunner's Hair</col> premium hairstyle!
data=col6,Reward Track
data=col7,Alongside new cosmetics available through droptable rewards, you can earn the new <col=FFFF00>Duskrunner's Blade</col> weapon override through the <col=FFFF00>bonus reward track</col>, guaranteed at 50 keys!
data=col9,Promotion Information
data=col10,trh209_promo_info_rewards

