data=col5,Unowned piece of the Springbloom Witch Outfit
data=col6,Unlock a piece of the Springbloom Witch Outfit cosmetic override, in the following order:<br>- Springbloom Witch Gloves<br>- Springbloom Witch Bottoms<br>- Springbloom Witch Hat<br>- Springbloom Witch Boots<br>- Springbloom Witch Top<br>If all pieces are owned, instead receive: Large prismatic fallen star (91% chance), 10 million coins (5% chance), Springbloom Hime hairstyle token (2% chance) or the Witch's Ride walk token (2% chance).

