// 17104
[uitutorial_helpbutton_league_relics_0]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,This is the Relic selection menu.<br><br>Each Relic tier contains a choice of Relics, all with unique powers.<br><br>Once you've gained enough points to unlock a Relic tier, you can choose any Relic from within it.
data=col6,league_parent_relics:main
data=col9,1

// 17105
[uitutorial_helpbutton_league_relics_1]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,Selecting a Relic will bring up the Relic information panel.<br><br>From there, you can view information on that Relic. If you have a relic choice available you may also choose to unlock it from the information panel.
data=col6,league_parent_relics:relic_main
data=col8,4

// 17106
[uitutorial_helpbutton_league_relics_2]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,You may only choose one Relic per tier and the choice can not be reversed once confirmed. Certain relics may also allow you to choose from a previous tier, so it's also worth looking at relics you can not yet claim to plan ahead!
data=col5,It is highly recommended to look at every relic closely!,15777401

