[trh175_promo_info_rewards_summary]
table=trh_promo_info_summary_entry
data=col0,These rewards are unique to the promotion and have a chance to be be won when fully filling the Harvest Bonus bar. Every third Harvest Bonus, you can choose to receive an unowned piece of the new Ripper Cosmetic Outfit.

