data=col11,By continuing with this purchase, you acknowledge that you have read and agree to our Terms and Conditions.<br><br>Your subscription will be charged to your App Store account at confirmation of purchase.<br><br>Any unused portion of a free trial will be forfeited if you purchase a subscription.<br><br>You authorise us to automatically charge you until you cancel your subscription. You can manage and cancel your subscription at anytime within your App Store account settings.<br><br>Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policy apply.
