[uitutorial_combat_hitchance_0]
table=uitutorial_step
data=col3,In the target information panel you can see your <col=FFCB05>hit chance</col> against the enemy.<br>This value will determine how much of your <col=FFCB05>damage potential</col> can be dealt against them.<br><br>Example: Your <col=FFCB05>Basic Attack</col> ability can deal a maximum of <col=FFCB05>100</col> damage and you have a <col=FFCB05>50%</col> hit chance against the target. Your ability will only be able to deal <col=FFCB05>50%</col> of it's <col=FFCB05>damage potential</col> resulting in a maximum of <col=FFCB05>50</col> damage.
