data=col7,4 Radiant Stars
data=col9,Contains 4 Radiant Stars that can be redeemed in a skill for Bonus XP.<br><br>Bonus XP is consumed to grant increased XP while skilling. For every base XP gained 1 Bonus XP will be consumed granting 1 additional overall XP.<br><br>Bonus XP from Radiant Stars scales based on the current level in a skill. Please see the Bonus XP Table for more information.
