data=col8,Contains 36 Radiant Stars that can be redeemed in a skill for Bonus XP.<br><br>Bonus XP is consumed to grant increased XP while skilling. For every base XP gained 1 Bonus XP will be consumed granting 1 additional overall XP.<br><br>Bonus XP from Radiant Stars scales based on the current level in a skill. Please see the Bonus XP Table for more information.
data=col10,marketplace_store_bonus_xp_extra_large_direct_purchase_data
data=col11,bonus xp
data=col12,bxp
data=col16,Save 22%

